msgid "Bind UFI SIM numbers onto a phone DID list (comma-separated). Outbound from the extension uses these DIDs as caller ID; inbound to a SIM rings this phone via the selected carrier group (typically VOS3000)."
msgstr "把 UFI 的 SIM 号追加到话机 DID 列表（逗号分隔）。分机打外线用这些 DID 作主叫；呼叫 SIM 号经所选运营商组（通常为 VOS3000）振铃该话机。"

